平凡的日子里 都是最浪漫的编排\n\n[Bridge]\n如今有了我们温馨的小家\n还有我们聪明可爱的天天\n看着他笑弯的眉眼 就像看到了你的模样\n\n[Final Chorus]\n飞哥，我的爱飞\n这十年的故事 盛开得如此绚烂\n有你，有天天，这就是最完美的答案\n\n[Outro]\n我的爱妃，我的飞哥……\n(Fade out)"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "编辑文本"}, "name": "编辑文本", "label": "编辑文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "编辑文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 63, "type": "MuyeTextEditOutput", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "MuyeTextEditOutput"}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "文本", "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "size": [320, 106], "pos": [760, 480], "widgets_values": ["### Global Metadata\n* Genre & Style: 90s J-Pop / Folk Rock / Classic Cantopop\n* Tempo: Mid-tempo (86 BPM), driving and rhythmic 4/4 folk-rock groove\n* Emotional Arc: Poetic, free-spirited, and uplifting warmth seamlessly evolving into deep family happiness\n* Production Profile: Nostalgic late-90s analogue acoustic rock production. Dominated by bright, continuous 12-string acoustic guitar strumming, prominent piano chords, warm electric bass, and crisp pop-rock drums with a spacious open room sound.\n\n### Vocal Details\n* Lead Vocal: Male lead, high-tenor register, bright, airy, and free-flowing tone. Effortless legato phrasing with crystal-clear head-voice accents, inspired by classic Asian acoustic rock balladeers.\n* Backing Vocals: Floating octave backing vocals and spacious \"ah\" harmonies during choruses.\n* Vocal Effects: Wide stereo plate reverb and slight analog delay, creating an airy, lifted, and open vocal presence.\n\n### Arrangement\n* Intro: Starts immediately with bright, rhythmic 12-string acoustic guitar strumming and a iconic, sweeping piano hook. Drums and bass hit together on beat 1, creating a strong, energetic 90s pop-rock opening.\n* Verse 1: Driving acoustic guitar rhythm continues non-stop. Clear male lead vocal sings cleanly over the acoustic guitar and steady bassline, with subtle piano fills.\n* Pre-Chorus: Snare drum builds up the rhythm, acoustic guitar strumming becomes more dynamic, swelling smoothly into the main chorus melody.\n* Chorus: Full folk-rock band explosion. Sparkling acoustic guitars, ringing piano chords, driving rock drumbeat, and soaring pop strings create an expansive, triumphant melody.\n* Verse 2: Dynamic drops slightly but keeps the driving acoustic guitar strumming pace, reflecting ten years of shared memories.\n* Chorus: Full energy returns with rich vocal harmonies and lifted acoustic rhythm.\n* Bridge: Acoustic guitar drops to clean quarter-note strumming alongside piano chords. As the story mentions home and son \"Tiantian\" (天天), soaring string countermelodies build up to a bright, radiant peak.\n* Final Chorus: Maximum energy. Full pop-rock band with soaring strings and layered harmonies, delivering a passionate, joyful celebration.\n* Outro: Drums fade, leaving the iconic 12-string acoustic guitar strumming and piano melody to play out together, ending on a crisp acoustic ring."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "编辑文本"}, "name": "编辑文本", "label": "编辑文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "编辑文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 64, "type": "MuyeTextEditOutput", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "MuyeTextEditOutput"}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "FLOAT", "label": "FLOAT", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "FLOAT"}], "size": [320, 106], "pos": [1140, 480], "widgets_values": [240.00000000000006], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "id": 65, "type": "Float", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Float"}, "order": 6}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "label": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "MODEL"}], "size": [320, 106], "pos": [0, 640], "widgets_values": ["default", "anima_baseV10.safetensors"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "unet_name"}, "name": "unet_name", "label": "unet_nam